    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>A `NavigableString` not subject to the normal formatting rules.

This is an abstract class used for special kinds of strings such
as comments (`Comment`) and CDATA blocks (`CData`).
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
